MiniDSP vendor data
-------------------
protocol/assets/audio_firmware/*/DSP_default_parameters.xml are MiniDSP Device
Console application resources, extracted from
Contents/Resources/device_support_package/DSP_Structures/.
third_party/legacy-configs/*/config.xml are manufacturer-derived SigmaStudio
exports obtained through minidsp-rs's devtools/src/codegen source-data corpus.
These XML files are retained for device interoperability: register definitions,
configuration interpretation, and default-preset generation. MiniDSP and any
other original rights holders retain their rights. These files are excluded
from this repository's MIT license; no MiniDSP redistribution license is granted
by this notice or inferred from their availability in minidsp-rs.

Generated data in docs/generated/device-support-matrix.json,
protocol/src/device/generated_official.rs, and build-generated default/reset
payloads derives from these vendor resources and other Device Console metadata.
The original extraction/generation code is MIT licensed; generating data does
not relicense the underlying vendor material. Preserve this provenance notice
with distributions containing the vendor data or generated descendants.

